{"id":2667,"date":"2026-06-09T13:14:20","date_gmt":"2026-06-09T13:14:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2667"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:25:24","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:25:24","slug":"kota-green-antique-stone","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/kota-green-antique-stone\/","title":{"rendered":"Kota Green Antique Stone"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"621\">Kota Green Antique is a premium natural stone known for its weathered appearance, earthy green tones, and distinctive antique finish. Designed to offer the charm of aged stone, it creates a timeless and sophisticated look that complements both traditional and contemporary architectural styles.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"968\">Its unique surface texture enhances the natural character of the stone, making it a preferred choice for architects, landscape designers, builders, and homeowners seeking an authentic natural finish. Whether used in residential, commercial, hospitality, or outdoor projects, Kota Green Antique adds warmth, depth, and visual appeal to any space.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1269\">The stone is highly durable and suitable for a wide range of applications including flooring, wall cladding, pathways, courtyards, garden areas, patios, and landscape features. Its natural variations in texture and color ensure that every installation possesses a distinctive and elegant appearance.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1470\">Combining durability, low maintenance, and timeless aesthetics, Kota Green Antique remains a popular choice for projects that require the beauty of natural stone with a rustic and enduring character.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1475\" \/>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11k4bfl\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1502\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1502\">Product Attributes<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<div clas